{"at": "2026-11-05T15:16:29.404037+00:00", "event_id": "01M6P4GTJWE7RDF8MAKJHCGG0A", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M6P4C2G98HWBH9NY8NJ44P3A", "final_answer": "Derive the cap from the measured worst case with the repository's existing #5378 headroom formula, record the derivation on the job, extend the guard that already owns the formula to this job, and make a budget expiry legible as INCOMPLETE/advisory via a step budget below the job cap plus a notice step. Reject the path/matrix shard: two live guards pin tree-wide corpus reach and a single pytest invocation. See plan.md Summary and IC-01..IC-04.", "mission_id": "01M6P49EBJZ15Q06S9XYQE61HX", "mission_slug": "corpus-advisory-budget-01M6P49E", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-11-05T15:16:29.404037Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M6P4C2G98HWBH9NY8NJ44P3A", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-05T15:16:29.401522Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-11-05T15:16:32.210363+00:00", "event_id": "01M6P4GXAJ4CW06S1C4X0ZM2ZW", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M6P4C2KT26F30S15ZTYC5TR6", "final_answer": "Known risks: the cap guard's block parser is indentation- and neighbour-sensitive (headroom line must sit directly above the job-level timeout-minutes); a step budget at or above the job cap is dead config; the recorded max can drift from reality (the 75% rule forces a cap bump when it grows); editing the suite step could accidentally change the selection (the recorded diff is the check). See plan.md IC-01..IC-03 Risks and WP01 Risks & Mitigations.", "mission_id": "01M6P49EBJZ15Q06S9XYQE61HX", "mission_slug": "corpus-advisory-budget-01M6P49E", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-11-05T15:16:32.210363Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M6P4C2KT26F30S15ZTYC5TR6", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-05T15:16:32.209396Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
